+    }
   }
 })
 ```
 
++ `customOptions`: options passed to the Ajv constructor. See the
+  [ajv options](https://ajv.js.org/options.html) for the full list.
++ `plugins`: Ajv plugins to apply, each given either as a plugin or as a
+  `[plugin, pluginOptions]` tuple. Each plugin must follow the
+  [Ajv plugin](https://ajv.js.org/guide/environments.html#ajv-plugins)
+  signature and return the Ajv instance.
++ `onCreate`: a function called with the Ajv instance after it is created
+  and the plugins are applied.
+
